evidence = "On main, services/agent/Cargo.lock:828 records layerx-client with its ed25519-dalek and related dependencies, and line 761 records the daemon's client dependency. Commit 93caf955b1 refreshed this workspace lock for the layerx-client and layerx-sdk manifest changes in task 22.99.158."

