status = "resolved"
evidence = "On main, services/agent/crates/layerx-client/src/sequencer.rs:873 requires exactly account, items, next_cursor, indexedHeight, chainHeight and freshness, and line 889 accepts a null or canonical hexadecimal cursor. Commit c56015fd36 landed this six-field decoder and aligned the human-node history producer with the declared JSON-RPC result."

