evidence = "On main, services/platform/hosted/core/src/public_reads.rs:95 compares committed balances using native.balance.bytes(), and line 136 reads asset metadata from the current PxAssetEntry fields. Commit 1a3c69501c landed these current-client consumers for task 22.31.485 while preserving the public response shape."

