evidence = "On main, services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/human_projection_facts.rs:541 imports the native budget store and line 581 calls the exported authority budget-state API with its current configuration type. Commit 9397b65f47 landed this repair and the matching human_approval_budget_actor consumer for task 22.31.497."

[disposition.22.95.1.7]
