evidence = "On main, services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/agent_rpc_wire.rs:851 defines prepare_digest beside NativeSendPrepareRequestV2, and line 3337 checks that method's digest against the signed request's expected digest. Commit b6d38a9897 landed the shared method and independent rpc_surface_major_two consumer for task 22.31.550."

[disposition.22.95.7.1]
