evidence = "Task 18.1548.1 supersedes 22.95.7 under decision 2459, and its result on main is the explicit viem Chain annotation at services/wallet/gateway/src/chain.ts:15 together with the Zod 4 key/value record schemas at services/wallet/gateway/src/routes/sign.ts:113 and services/wallet/gateway/src/schemas/agent.ts:63. Commit c3980b312c landed both parts with the typed-data record tests."
